						(size 0.8128 0.8128)
					)
				)
			)
			(text "These pins are reserved for ID EEPROM\\n\\nAt boot time this I2C interface will be\\ninterrogated to look for an EEPROM\\nthat identifies the attached board and\\nallows automagic setup of the GPIOs\\n(and optionally, Linux drivers)."
				(at 177.8762 55.0164 0)
				(effects
